@startuml
!theme mars
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Tamu" as Tamu
boundary "Halaman\nRegistrasi" as UI
control "Sistem" as System
database "DB Registrations" as DB
participant "WA Gateway" as WA
actor "Admin" as Admin

== Review & Persetujuan Admin ==

WA -> Admin : Notifikasi WA:\nAda registrasi baru

Admin -> UI : Login & buka dashboard
activate UI
UI -> System : GET /api/registrations\n?status=pending
deactivate UI
activate System

System -> DB : Ambil data pending
activate DB
DB --> System : Daftar registrasi
deactivate DB

System --> UI : Data registrasi
deactivate System
activate UI
UI --> Admin : Tampilkan data review
deactivate UI

alt Admin Menyetujui
    Admin -> UI : Klik Setujui &\ninput jadwal pemasangan
    activate UI
    UI -> System : PUT /api/registrations/:id/approve
    deactivate UI
    activate System

    System -> DB : UPDATE status = approved
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Berhasil
    deactivate DB

    System -> WA : Kirim WA persetujuan\n+ jadwal pemasangan
    activate WA
    WA --> System : Terkirim
    deactivate WA
    WA --> Tamu : Terima WA persetujuan

    System -> DB : INSERT audit log
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Log tersimpan
    deactivate DB

    System --> UI : Berhasil
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> Admin : Registrasi disetujui
    deactivate UI

else Admin Menolak
    Admin -> UI : Klik Tolak &\ninput alasan penolakan
    activate UI
    UI -> System : PUT /api/registrations/:id/reject
    deactivate UI
    activate System

    System -> DB : UPDATE status = rejected
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Berhasil
    deactivate DB

    System -> WA : Kirim WA penolakan\n+ alasan
    activate WA
    WA --> System : Terkirim
    deactivate WA
    WA --> Tamu : Terima WA penolakan

    System -> DB : INSERT audit log
    activate DB
    DB --> System : Log tersimpan
    deactivate DB

    System --> UI : Berhasil
    deactivate System
    activate UI
    UI --> Admin : Registrasi ditolak
    deactivate UI
end

@enduml
